sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OPS as Ops Agent
    participant UI as Ops Console
    participant SV as Shipping Service
    participant BA as Bosta Adapter
    participant BO as Bosta API
    participant ST as Object Storage
    participant NT as Notification Dispatcher
    participant VP as Vendor Portal
    actor VD as Vendor

    Note over OPS,VD: Requirement 3.1, 3.2, 9 - AWB per ITEM, not per order

    OPS->>UI: open order #30537 (3 items, 3 vendors)
    UI->>SV: get shippable items
    SV-->>UI: 30537-1 ready, 30537-2 ready, 30537-3 OOS

    Note over UI: Only the available items are<br/>selectable. The order is NOT<br/>held hostage by the OOS item.

    OPS->>UI: select 30537-1, choose courier = Bosta
    UI->>SV: createShipment(item 30537-1)

    SV->>SV: acquire lock on order_item<br/>(prevents duplicate AWB)
    SV->>BA: buildPayload(item, pickup location, COD amount)
    Note right of BA: COD amount is item-level:<br/>item price + allocated shipping,<br/>not the whole order total.

    BA->>BO: POST /deliveries
    alt Bosta returns success
        BO-->>BA: {trackingNumber, awbPdfUrl}
        BA->>SV: shipment created
        SV->>ST: store AWB PDF
        SV->>SV: INSERT SHIPMENTS + SHIPMENT_EVENTS(Created)
        SV->>SV: order_item status -> Ready-To-Ship
    else Bosta 4xx (bad address / zone)
        BO-->>BA: 400 validation error
        BA-->>UI: surface field-level error to agent
        Note right of UI: Agent corrects address inline<br/>and retries. No silent failure.
    else Bosta 5xx / timeout
        BO-->>BA: error
        BA->>BA: retry w/ backoff, idempotency key
        Note right of BA: Idempotency key = order_item id,<br/>so a retry after a timeout never<br/>creates a second AWB.
    end

    SV->>NT: shipmentCreated(item, vendor, pdf)
    par push to portal
        NT->>VP: attach AWB PDF to vendor dashboard
    and email the vendor
        NT->>VD: email AWB PDF
    end

    VD->>VP: log in, print label immediately
    Note over VD,VP: No manual step by Ops.<br/>Removes the current WhatsApp<br/>label-sending workflow.

    OPS->>UI: 30537-3 stays OOS -> separate flow
    Note over UI: See OOS / cancellation activity diagram.
